; The enhanced game's «Улучшения» panel (branch `remaster`, not part of the original): the third
; sub-tab of Options > графика. Port-own layout read by the same engine from a second directory
; (nfs_game::remaster), loaded as the panel `ID_ENHPANEL` that graphics_entry.lay (spliced into
; graphics.lay at load) names and graphicstabs_entry.lay's tab button selects; it is a panel layout
; like graphicsettings.lay / advgraphics.lay (no screen of its own, the Options oval behind).
; Built from widget types the original's display.lay uses. The rows (a caption label + a level
; combo bound to Enh.<token>) and the page button are NOT in this file: they are generated from the
; switch registry (nfs_renderer::ENHANCEMENT_REGISTRY) and inserted after section 0 at load (ahead of
; the backgrounds, which would take their clicks: remaster::with_rows), so adding a registry
; entry adds a row. Strings are the port's own table (ids 900000 and up), not FEStrings.loc.
[section.0]
id=REAL.BLACK_640x480
name=ID_SCREEN
size=640,480
color=0xff0000ff
screen=
room=
callbacklist=
musicfile=menu*
canplaygame=

